NAME
  /cfg.loaded - Show what the config load loaded: plugins, symbols, devices.

CURRENT STATE
  Loaded - 5 files
  KIND     NAME                          LAYER  FILE                     COUNT  NOTE
  -- -- -- -- -- --
  plugin   cmd                           demo   plugin/cmd.py                1  commands crcsend
