demo> /help proto
NAME
  /proto - Binary protocol tools: send, run, debug, hex, crc, info.

SYNOPSIS
  /proto -- bare: opens the Proto picker in the TUI; elsewhere runs /proto.list

DESCRIPTION
  Talk to a device that speaks bytes rather than lines: send raw bytes,
  run protocol test scripts, debug a test step by step, and work out CRCs.

  3 scripts in proto/

  Send examples:
    /proto.send 01 02 03         - send three hex bytes
    /proto.send "AT\r"           - send text with carriage return
    /proto.send 0x01 "hello" 0D  - mix hex and text
    /proto.send 00 ~25ms "AT\r"  - wake byte, 25ms pause, then command
    /proto.send ~500us 01 02     - 500us delay before data

  Inline delays use ~duration syntax (us, ms, s). Delays under
  1ms use spin-wait for precision. Delays >= 1ms use OS sleep.

  Send with CRC (algorithm name with optional _le/_be/_ascii suffixes):
    /proto.send crc16-modbus 01 03 00 00 00 0A            - append LE CRC (default)
    /proto.send crc16-modbus_be 01 03 00 00 00 0A         - append BE CRC
    /proto.send crc16-modbus_ascii "READ 0000"             - append CRC as hex text
    /proto.send crc16-modbus_be_ascii 01 03 00 00 00 0A   - BE CRC as hex text

  CRC tools:
    /proto.crc.list              - list all 100+ algorithms
    /proto.crc.list *modbus*     - filter by glob pattern
    /proto.crc.info crc16-modbus - show parameters for Modbus CRC
    /proto.crc.calc crc16-modbus 01 03 00 00 00 01  - compute CRC

  Script files (.pro) support TOML format with [[test]] sections
  or flat format with send:/expect: directives. Scripts are found
  in the proto/ subfolder of your config directory.

SUBCOMMANDS
  /proto.crc        Browse and compute CRC algorithms.
  /proto.debug      Interactive protocol debug screen.
  /proto.delete     Delete a file from proto/, after a yes.
  /proto.dump       Print the newest (or named) file from proto/ to the terminal.
  /proto.edit       Open a .pro file for editing.
  /proto.explore    Open proto/ in the system file explorer.
  /proto.help       Show /proto help.
  /proto.hex        Toggle hex display of incoming bytes (same flag as /term.hex).
  /proto.info       Print current protocol state.
  /proto.list       List .pro scripts, newest first, with size, age, and the name each declares.
  /proto.rename     Rename a file in proto/ (extension kept; never overwrites).
  /proto.run        Run a protocol test script.
  /proto.send       Send raw bytes (with optional CRC), show response.
  /proto.show       Open the newest (or named) file in proto/ with the system viewer.

SCRIPTS
  proto/ - 3 scripts
  NAME SIZE UPDATED TITLE
  -- -- -- --
  at_test.pro  <SIZE>  just now  Demo AT Command Test
  bitfield_inline.pro  <SIZE>  just now  Demo Bitfield Inline Format
  modbus_inline.pro  <SIZE>  just now  Demo Modbus Inline Format
