demo> /print === section: help.plugin ===
  === section: help.plugin ===
demo> /help.plugin
-- Application --
  /cli          Already in CLI mode.
  /tui          Switch to TUI mode.

-- Application Plugins --
  /app          App-wide state, config and running sessions.
  /board        Starter projects for real dev boards: list, new, firmware.
  /cap          Data capture tools.
  /cfg          Show or set config values.
  /cls          Clear the terminal screen.
  /credits      Print acknowledgments / third-party attributions.
  /delay        Wait for a duration (e.g. 500ms, 1.5s); Escape or Ctrl+C cancels.
  /demo         Switch to the built-in demo device (creates its config if needed).
  /dev          Device files: a part's registers as data (see /help devices).
  /edit         Open a project file for editing (run/, proto/ or plugin/).
  /env          Print environment variables for $(env.NAME) expansion (alias: /env.list).
  /exit         Exit termapy.
  /find         Navigate scrollback matches with an interactive find bar.
  /firmware     Device-side sources termapy ships: list, copy, show, dump.
  /grep         Search the scrollback for lines matching a pattern (case-insensitive regex).
  /help         Print the command landscape or look up a specific command.
  /log          Session log: start, stop, print, fingerprint, or open it.
  /mcp          MCP catalog and status (Model Context Protocol).
  /mem          Device memory: dump, typed reads, writes and bit ops via /sym names.
  /os           Run a shell command and show output (10s timeout). e.g. /os dir
  /ping         Send a command and measure response time.
  /plugin       Plugin-folder tools: list, explore, show, dump, edit.
  /port         Serial port tools: connect, disconnect, list, configure.
  /print        Print a message to the terminal.
  /profile      Device profile commands (MCP profile schema, validator, loader).
  /proto        Binary protocol tools: send, run, debug, hex, crc, info.
  /raw          Send raw text to serial (no transforms or line ending).
  /repeat       Repeat a command N times with optional delay (escape to cancel).
  /run          Run a script file, or list available scripts.
  /search       Deep-search every command's metadata (name, help, args, flags, long help).
  /seq          Print sequence counters.
  /show         Show a file.
  /ss           Screenshot tools: save SVG/text, manage folder.
  /stop         Abort a running script.
  /sym          Symbol table: name -> address, or address -> name+offset.
  /term         Terminal display / session toggles (echo, line_no, timestamps, ...).
  /var          List user variables, or show one by name.
  /xfer         File transfer: settings and XMODEM / YMODEM send and receive.

-- demo Plugins --
  /crcsend      Send text with XMODEM CRC-16 appended.
  /probe        Query the device and display the response.
  /temp_plot    Sample temperature and show ASCII sparkline.

-- Script Commands (.run files only) --
  /confirm      Show Yes/Cancel dialog; Cancel stops a running script.
  /expect       Wait for text in serial output (blocks until match or timeout).
  45 commands.
