demo> /help.dev print
NAME
  /print - Print a message to the terminal.

STATUS
  stable - tested and part of the standard release

SYNOPSIS
  /print <text>

DESCRIPTION (developer)
  Write a message to the terminal output.

    Prints the argument text directly to the terminal. Useful in
    scripts for status messages or visual separators.

  Args:
      ctx: Plugin context for output.
      args: Text to print.

AVAILABLE
  TUI: yes   CLI: yes (current)   MCP: yes

SUBCOMMANDS
