demo> /help.dev ss.list
NAME
  /ss.list - List files in ss/, newest first, with size and age.

STATUS
  stable - tested and part of the standard release

DESCRIPTION (developer)
    List the screenshots in the config's ss/ folder, newest first, with size and age.

REQUIRED CAPABILITIES
  config_loaded - a loaded config

AVAILABLE
  TUI: yes   CLI: yes (current)   MCP: yes

SEE ALSO
  /ss.delete, /ss.explore, /ss.rename, /ss.show, /ss.svg, /ss.txt, /ss
